          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Jesu waambira, “Makosa genu nkukala tammanya Maandiko wala uwezo wa Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu ndiphofufuka andakala dza malaika hiko mlunguni ambao taalóla wala taalólwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.3.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 3:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwasoma vitabu vya Musa ela tamdzangbwemanya kukala atu andafufulwa! Seemu ihusuyo chira chitsaka chokala chinaaka moho, Mlungu wamuamba Musa, ‘Mimi ni Mlungu wa Burahimu, wa Isaka na wa Jakobo.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:26",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ndani ya Chitabu cha Kutsama 3:6 na 3:15, Mlungu wamuambira Musa maneno higa miaka minji ambapho Burahimu, Isaka na Jakobo kala akafwa kare.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo, iye ni Mlungu wa atu hinyo dzagbwe afwa kare. Higa ganaonyesa kukala afwadzi kpwakpwe achere moyo. Mwimwi Masadukayo munakosera sana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
