            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwalimu mmwenga wa Shariya watsoloka na achisikira Jesu na Masadukayo anashindana kuhusu mambo ga kufufulwa. Ariphoona Jesu akaajibu vinono, wadzituluza, achimuuza, “Kulengana na shariya zosi za Mlungu ni iphi ya muhimu kuriko zosi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.4+DEU.6.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 6:4–5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu wajibu achiamba, “Ya muhimu zaidi ni hino: ‘Phundzani mwimwi Aiziraeli! Mwenyezi Mlungu wehu, Mwenyezi Mlungu ni mmwenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mmendzeni Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu na mioyo yenu yosi, na roho zenu zosi, na achili zenu zosi na mkpwotse wenu wosi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 19:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ya phiri inaamba, ‘Mmendze myao dza vyo udzimendzavyo mwenye.’ Takuna shariya muhimu zaidi kuriko hizi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
