            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ariphoona kukala hiyu mutu akagombato, wamuamba, “Uwe kukure na ufalume wa Mlungu.” Bada ya higo atu osi aogopha kumuuza swali rorosi.",
          "type": "text",
