            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati Jesu kala anafundza waamba, “Dzimanyirireni na alimu a Shariya! Mana nkumendza kuvwala kandzu nyire na kutsupa-tsupa hiko cheteni ili alamuswe na ishima mbere za atu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya anamendza kusagala vihi vya mbere-mbere masinagogini na karamuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela nkuafuta magungu vitu vyao, na kudzihenda kala ni atu anono kpwa kuvoya mavoyo mare! Siku ya mwisho atu dza hinyo andaphaha adabu kali sana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ariphokala ndani ya Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu, wasagala phephi na sanduku ra kuikira pesa za sadaka. Achikala analola kundi kulu ra atu atiyavyo pesa mura sandukuni. Matajiri anji alavya pesa nyinji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha phachedza mayo mmwenga gungu mgbwayi, achilavya senti mbiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Jesu achiaambira anafundzie, “Lolani hiyu mayo. Nakuambirani kpweli, hiyu gungu mchiya akatiya pesa nyinji kuriko anjina osi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana anjina osi akatiya kulengana na fwaida ya mali arizo nazo. Ela hiyu mayo, dzagbwe ni mchiya, akalavya pesa zosi achizokala nazo, hata vivi kana chitu cha kumterya kuishi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.44"
